<title>USA: Hardinge to buy back 10 pct of common stk.</title>
<headline>Hardinge to buy back 10 pct of common stk.</headline>
<dateline>ELMIRA, N.Y. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hardinge Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 640,000 common shares or about 10 percent of the total number outstanding.  </p>
<p>The machine tool producer said it would buy back the shares through open market transactions from time to time as market conditions warrant.</p>
<p>It said it already had 6.47 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;This program is an expression of our confidence in the company's short-term and long-term earnings outlook and our growth potential, and we believe it will enhance returns to our shareholders,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
